  "prompt": "A cheerful teal party hat with a tall taper of stacked progressively smaller cuboids, orange and cream painted confetti, and a tiny gold pom at its tip. Original hat only, no animal/head/stand/background/text. For tiny vanilla Minecraft pets: 4-18 purposeful unrotated axis-aligned cuboids. Geometry within x=2..14,z=2..14,y=0..14, centre x=z=8, flat underside at y=0, front negative Z. One compact painted cube-net texture atlas, pixel art at one texel per unit. Explicit integer uvSize for fractional details. Connected pieces without z-fighting. No bones or animations. Uniformly scaled to an animal forehead with no straps or parts below y=0.",
